! ---- DDR: CODE V default drawing rules (only EDG for now).  DDR EDG f makes
! the default edge (physical) aperture f times the clear aperture: the System
! Configuration's "Default Clear Aperture Margin", 10% = DDR EDG 1.10.  It
! belongs to the lens: saved (after GO) and restored, reset on a new lens.
RES osdtriplet
DDR
DDR EDG 1.10
DDR ?
SAV ddrtest
PRT ddrtest
! another lens: back to no margin; reloading restores 1.10
RES osdtriplet
DDR
RES ddrtest
DDR
LEN NEW
DDR
! errors
DDR EDG 0.5
DDR SCA 2
DDR EDG
